{"speciesId":426,"names":{"fr":"Grodrive","es":"Drifblim","en":"Drifblim","ja":"フワライド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It’s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Des nuées de Grodrive dérivent dans le ciel au crépuscule. Ils disparaissent dès qu’on les voit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Des nuées de Grodrive dérivent dans le ciel au crépuscule. Ils disparaissent dès qu’on les voit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut embarquer des gens et des Pokémon, mais nul ne sait où il va atterrir car il ne fait que flotter."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Transporta a gente y a Pokémon volando, pero, como se deja llevar, puede acabar en cualquier sitio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"人や ポケモンを 乗せて 飛ぶが 風に 流されているだけなので どこへ 飛んでいくか わからない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il somnole la journée et s’envole en grands groupes le soir venu. Nul ne sait où ils vont."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Durante el día está somnoliento, pero por la noche sale volando en grupo, aunque nadie sabe adónde."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"昼間は 寝ぼけて 浮かんでいるが 夕方 大群で 飛んでいく。 行先は だれも 知らない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il peut embarquer des gens et des Pokémon, mais nul ne sait où il va atterrir car il ne fait que flotter."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Transporta a gente y a Pokémon volando, pero, como se deja llevar, puede acabar en cualquier sitio."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"人や ポケモンを 乗せて 飛ぶが 風に 流されているだけなので どこへ 飛んでいくか わからない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il somnole la journée et s’envole en grands groupes le soir venu. Nul ne sait où ils vont."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Durante el día está somnoliento, pero por la noche sale volando en grupo, aunque nadie sabe adónde."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"昼間は 寝ぼけて 浮かんでいるが 夕方 大群で 飛んでいく。 行先は だれも 知らない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un jour, un homme a grimpé sur un Grodrive pour partir en voyage. Personne ne l’a jamais revu."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Hubo un caso de un chico que se subió a un Drifblim y salió de viaje. Desde entonces está en paradero desconocido."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"There was once an incident in which a man took a trip riding a Drifblim, only to go missing."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"フワライドに 乗って 旅に出た 男が そのまま 行方不明に なったという 事件が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Même si à la tombée de la nuit on peut observer des nuées entières de Grodrive, elles finissent toujours par s’évanouir dans la nature."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Al anochecer, se reúnen en grupos y vuelan a la deriva. Si alguien trata de seguirlos con la mirada, desaparecen al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"夕暮れに 飛ぶ フワライドの 大群は じっと 観察して いても いつのまにか 消えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si l’on en croit la rumeur, il serait possible de se rendre dans l’au-delà en se laissant porter par le vent nocturne, accroché à un Grodrive."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se rumorea que los Drifblim que surcan el cielo al ocaso llevan a todos aquellos que atrapan al más allá."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"There’s a rumor that if you catch a Drifblim floating on the wind at dusk, you’ll be carried away to the afterlife."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"夕闇を 風に 乗って 飛ぶ フワライドに 捕まると あの世へ 運ばれるという ウワサだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son gaz est essentiellement composé d’âmes. Si par malheur son corps se dégonfle, on dit qu’il entraîne humains et Pokémon dans sa chute."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El gas que alberga su interior se compone de almas. Si su cuerpo se deshincha, arrastra consigo tanto a personas como a Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The raw material for the gas inside its body is souls. When its body starts to deflate, it’s thought to carry away people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"体内の ガスの 原料は 魂。 身体が しぼんでくると 人や ポケモンを 連れ去るという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon, qui flotte silencieusement au crépuscule, serait né des âmes des défunts rongés par les regrets."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se dice que está formado por almas en pena. Al caer la noche, flota a la deriva en silencio sepulcral."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Some say this Pokémon is a collection of souls burdened with regrets, silently drifting through the dusk."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"無念の 死を とげた 魂が 集まった 姿とも いわれる。 宵闇を 音も なく 漂う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il attrape des personnes et des Pokémon pour les transporter vers une destination inconnue."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Agarra a gente y a Pokémon para llevárselos a algún sitio, aunque nadie sabe exactamente adónde."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It grabs people and Pokémon and carries them off somewhere. Where do they go? Nobody knows."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人や ポケモンを つかんで そのまま どこかへ 運んでいく。 行き先は だれも 知らない。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It drifts along at dusk, perfectly silent. Its transient, melancholy aspect touches some people deeply—every so often, one will come upon a song or poem devoted to Drifblim."}],"varieties":[{"id":426,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",11],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",11],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",11],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",11],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"lev